  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#event-loop-processing-model:concept-task\r\n\r\n> If there is no such task queue, then jump to the microtasks step below\\.\r\n\r\nIn this case the initialization of `oldestTask` in step 2 and `taskStartTime` in step 4 would be skipped, even though they are used in steps 10.2, 10.3 and 11.3.",
